        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "alt": "Sketch of two gammon steaks in frying pan",
        "credit": "Illustration based on the HelloFresh recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-5",
      "number": 5,
      "heading": "Reduce the glaze",
      "blocks": [
        "Clean the pan again and return to high heat. Simmer honey and pineapple juice for 3–4 minutes until syrupy. Stir in mustard and {{glaze-butter}} butter until melted, then remove from the heat."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
